  <div id="sutta">
  
                <h3 id="AN5.177" class="h1">Business (Wrong Livelihood)<br/>
                  Vaṇijjā Sutta  (AN 5:177)</h3><!--end suttahead-->
                <p>“Monks, a lay follower should not engage in five types of business. Which five? Business in weapons, business in living beings, business in meat, business in intoxicants, and business in poison.</p>
                <p>“These are the five types of business a lay follower should not engage in.”</p>
                <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../SN/SN42_2.html">SN 42:2–3</a>; <a href="AN4_79.html">AN 4:79</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
